#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Needs your input"
msgstr "Falta tu dato"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Required, and nobody has given it"
msgstr "Obligatorio, y nadie lo ha dado"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:205
msgid ""
"Press Enter on a box and read the panel: for a calculated box it shows "
"the formula with the numbers in it, for a box from your records it says "
"what was added up. Where a box can be replaced, the panel says so and "
"explains that your records do not change."
msgstr ""
"Pulsa Enter sobre una casilla y lee el panel: para una casilla calculada "
"muestra la fórmula con los números, para una casilla de tus registros "
"dice qué se sumó. Donde una casilla se puede sustituir, el panel lo dice "
"y explica que tus registros no cambian."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:210
msgid ""
"**Override a value.** Type your own value over one that comes from your "
"records. The row then reads \"Yours, replaces your records\". The panel "
"says your value replaces the amount from your records in this declaration"
" only, and lets you go back to the source."
msgstr ""
"**Sustituir un valor.** Escribe tu propio valor sobre uno que procede de "
"tus registros. La fila dice entonces «Tuyo, sustituye tus registros». El "
"panel indica que tu valor sustituye el importe de tus registros solo en "
"esta declaración y te permite volver a la fuente."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:215
msgid ""
"**Go back to the source.** Open the box and choose **Go back to the "
"source's value** when its panel offers it. Review and apply this change "
"with `R`. The `u` key only undoes a change you have not applied."
msgstr ""
"**Volver a la fuente.** Abre la casilla y elige **Volver al valor del "
"origen** cuando el panel lo ofrezca. Revisa y aplica este cambio con `R`."
" La tecla `u` solo deshace un cambio que aún no has aplicado."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:219
msgid ""
"**Open the source area.** If the panel offers an action such as **Open "
"Records**, choose it to correct the source there, then return and "
"recalculate."
msgstr ""
"**Abrir el área de la fuente.** Si el panel ofrece una acción como "
"**Abrir Registros**, elígela para corregir allí la fuente y después "
"vuelve y recalcula."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:222
msgid ""
"**See every source at once.** Press `s` for the sources map. It counts "
"boxes, not sources: how many come from your records, earlier declarations"
" and AEAT data, how many you entered, confirmed or replaced, what is "
"assumed and what is calculated. \"None found\" means Cadrumo looked in "
"that source and found nothing, which is different from zero. Press Enter "
"on a line to see its boxes, and Enter on a box to go to it."
msgstr ""
"**Ver todos los orígenes a la vez.** Pulsa `s` para el mapa de orígenes. "
"Cuenta casillas, no orígenes: cuántas vienen de tus registros, "
"declaraciones anteriores y datos de la AEAT, cuántas introdujiste, "
"confirmaste o sustituiste, qué es supuesto y qué es calculado. «No se "
"encontró nada» significa que Cadrumo buscó en ese origen y no encontró "
"nada, lo que es distinto de cero. Pulsa Enter en una línea para ver sus "
"casillas, y Enter en una casilla para ir a ella."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:229
msgid "Calculate"
msgstr "Calcular"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:231
msgid ""
"Press F8 to run the step the header offers, or `c` to calculate at any "
"time once your changes are applied. The values you entered are kept. "
"Press `c` whenever the header says ◷ \"out of date: recalculate\", for "
"example after your records changed."
msgstr ""
"Pulsa F8 para ejecutar el paso que ofrece la cabecera, o `c` para "
"calcular en cualquier momento una vez aplicados tus cambios. Los valores "
"que has introducido se conservan. Pulsa `c` siempre que la cabecera diga "
"◷ «desactualizado: vuelve a calcular», por ejemplo después de que tus "
"registros hayan cambiado."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:236
msgid ""
"If the declaration was last calculated without saved input history, "
"calculating asks first and names the boxes whose values go back to their "
"source."
msgstr ""
"Si la declaración se calculó por última vez fuera de la pantalla de la "
"declaración, al calcular te pregunta primero y nombra las casillas cuyos "
"valores vuelven a su origen."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:239
msgid ""
"The first Modelo 303 calculation asks the filing answers its period "
"needs: whether you file a joint return and, in the last period of the "
"year, whether you are exempt from Modelo 390."
msgstr ""
"El primer cálculo del Modelo 303 pide las respuestas de presentación que "
"necesita su periodo: si presentas una declaración conjunta y, en el "
"último periodo del año, si estás exonerado de presentar el Modelo 390."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:243
msgid "Check and fix issues"
msgstr "Comprobar y corregir incidencias"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:245
msgid ""
"Press `i` to open **Issues to look at**. The header shows the same "
"counts, one per level:"
msgstr ""
"Pulsa `i` para abrir **Incidencias para revisar**. La cabecera muestra "
"los mismos recuentos, uno por nivel:"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Level"
msgstr "Nivel"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "What it means"
msgstr "Qué significa"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "▲"
msgstr "▲"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Blocks filing"
msgstr "Impide presentar"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Fix it before you can export or record the filing"
msgstr "Corrígelo antes de poder exportar o registrar la presentación"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "A required value nobody has given"
msgstr "Un valor obligatorio que nadie ha dado"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "A value nobody entered; confirm it or type the right one"
msgstr "Un valor que nadie introdujo; confírmalo o escribe el correcto"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "◆"
msgstr "◆"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Worth checking"
msgstr "Conviene revisarlo"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "Does not stop you"
msgstr "No te impide presentar"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "`i`"
msgstr "`i`"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "For your information"
msgstr "Para tu información"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md
msgid "An explanation"
msgstr "Una explicación"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:256
msgid ""
"Each issue says what is wrong, what to do and where. Press Enter on an "
"issue to go to its box, or to open its details or the area that owns the "
"problem. Press `t` for technical details."
msgstr ""
"Cada incidencia dice qué está mal, qué hacer y dónde. Pulsa Enter en una "
"incidencia para ir a su casilla, o para abrir sus detalles o el área a la"
" que pertenece el problema. Pulsa `t` para ver los detalles técnicos."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:260
msgid ""
"Problems found while calculating appear in the same list. An amount from "
"your records that lands in no box, or any other problem that could make "
"you under-declare, is marked ▲ and blocks export and recording. A problem"
" that would only make you pay more is marked ◆. After a change, problems "
"from the last calculation are labelled as such until you calculate again."
msgstr ""
"Las incidencias encontradas al calcular aparecen en la misma lista. Un "
"importe de tus registros que no cae en ninguna casilla, o cualquier otra "
"incidencia que pudiera hacerte declarar de menos, se marca con ▲ y "
"bloquea la exportación y el registro. Una incidencia que solo te haría "
"pagar más se marca con ◆. Tras un cambio, las incidencias del último "
"cálculo se etiquetan como tales hasta que vuelvas a calcular."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:266
msgid ""
"Press F8 at the Check step to check the declaration. A box that stops you"
" from filing shows ▲, and the navigator counts it on its section."
msgstr ""
"Pulsa F8 en el paso Comprobar para comprobar la declaración. Una casilla "
"que te impide presentar muestra ▲, y el panel de navegación la cuenta en "
"su sección."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:269
msgid "Create the file and record the filing"
msgstr "Crear el fichero y registrar la presentación"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:271
msgid "Resolve every ▲ and confirm every ◐."
msgstr "Resuelve cada ▲ y confirma cada ◐."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:272
msgid ""
"Press `e`, choose where to save the file, which file to write and, for "
"Modelo 303, the refund, payment and direct debit choices. The result says"
" that the file has not been sent to the AEAT."
msgstr ""
"Pulsa `e`, elige dónde guardar el fichero, qué fichero escribir y, para "
"el Modelo 303, las opciones de devolución, ingreso y domiciliación. El "
"resultado dice que el fichero no se ha enviado a la AEAT."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:275
msgid "File with the AEAT yourself: [File at AEAT](file-at-aeat.md)."
msgstr "Preséntala tú en la AEAT: [Presentar en la AEAT](file-at-aeat.md)."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:276
msgid "Press F8 to record the filing. Cadrumo asks you to confirm."
msgstr "Pulsa F8 para registrar la presentación. Cadrumo te pide que lo confirmes."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:278
msgid "The header then reads \"Recorded as filed\" with the date."
msgstr "La cabecera dice entonces «Registrada como presentada» con la fecha."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:280
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A recorded declaration opens read-only: attention marks are hidden and "
"editing is refused. To change it, {ref}`start a correction <correct-an-"
"already-filed-local-record>` (complementaria or rectificativa)."
msgstr ""
"Una declaración registrada como presentada se abre solo para lectura: se "
"ocultan las marcas de atención y no se permite editarla. Para cambiarla, "
"{ref}`inicia una corrección <correct-an-already-filed-local-record>` "
"(complementaria o rectificativa)."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:284
msgid "Look up a symbol"
msgstr "Consultar un símbolo"

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:286
msgid ""
"Press `?` once. The help band opens and its first line lists the symbols "
"on this screen, with counts."
msgstr ""
"Pulsa `?` una vez. Se abre la banda de ayuda y su primera línea enumera "
"los símbolos de esta pantalla, con recuentos."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:288
msgid ""
"Press `?` a second time to open **Symbols and keys**: every symbol with "
"its meaning, grouped, and the keys. Press Esc or `?` to close it."
msgstr ""
"Pulsa `?` una segunda vez para abrir **Símbolos y teclas**: cada símbolo "
"con su significado, agrupados, y las teclas. Pulsa Esc o `?` para "
"cerrarlo."

#: ../../how-to/fill-in-and-file-in-the-workbench.md:290
msgid ""
"The first time you open a declaration, a notice says \"New here? Press ? "
"to see what each symbol means.\""
msgstr ""
"La primera vez que abres una declaración, un aviso dice «¿Es tu primera "
"vez? Pulsa ? para ver qué significa cada símbolo.»"

